Great fun. almost like a modern more relistic version of minecraft. I love the building aspect of the game, The only bummer is you cannot dig up the ground and mine underneath. Great game to play on your own or in a group with plenty of fun servers to play on.
It would be nice to have some warning in advance on updates though as its annoying to try connect to a server after they release a new update only to find none of the servers you normally play on have been updated and having to wait for ages for server admins to relise this. {meaning no game play until they update the server also.}
Apart from these small issue's for an early release game its seems good so far, and i do recommend it.
